<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

This demonstration has shown a few possibilties for using &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; in your XUI files.
For information on other &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, or more information on the ones that you've seen here... please consult the XUI documentation and other available samples.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;

If you'd like to start making your own &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Controls&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;, you can start by exploring the &lt;i&gt;skin_default.xui&lt;/i&gt; file that is used for this demonstration, and using that as a reference for creating your own look and feel.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

